# Dependency (CR 613.8a): Conspiracy's "Creatures you control are the chosen type" and Opalescence's "Each other non-Aura
# enchantment is a creature" are both layer-4 effects, and applying Opalescence's changes what Conspiracy's applies to, so
# Conspiracy's depends on it and waits for it - though Conspiracy (turn 1) is older than Opalescence (turn 5), and in
# timestamp order Conspiracy's would have found no creature among the enchantments. So Glorious Anthem and Conspiracy
# itself, enchantment creatures, are Merfolk (the chosen type). In layer 7b each is its mana value, Conspiracy 5/5 and the
# Anthem 3/3, and in 7c the Anthem's "Creatures you control get +1/+1" makes them 6/6 and 4/4. Opalescence is no creature,
# so no Merfolk.

